OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found dead in park pond
OL,4,
OL,5,FPolice are investigating after the body
OL,6,Fof a woman was found in a pond at a
OL,7,Fpark.
OL,9,FLancashire Police said officers were
OL,10,Fcalled to reports of a body at Lowther
OL,11,FGardens on Lowther Terrace, Lytham at
OL,12,F09:00 BST.
OL,14,FThe force said inquiries are continuing
OL,15,Fto establish her identity.
OL,17,FHer death is currently being treated as
OL,18,F"unexplained".
